# This is a module SOURCE repo — it holds module source, not a built app.
# Nothing here needs installing; keep dependency/build cruft out.
node_modules/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# READ BEFORE EDITING ANYTHING BELOW THIS LINE.
#
# WORKING/ holds everything that isn't source: disposable JonDash installs used
# to test modules (WORKING/testbed/), notes, scratch. It is ~8 GB, and each
# testbed is a whole copy of the app PLUS its database — prisma/dev.db,
# .data/secrets.json, session tokens, the lot.
#
# This repo is PUBLIC. These entries are not tidiness; they are the only thing
# between that data and a public push. Weakening one, or putting a working
# folder somewhere not listed here, publishes it.
#
# The working area lives inside the checkout by owner decision (2026-07-25), on
# the condition that it is documented and ignored fully. See WORKING/README.md.
# Verify rather than assume, whenever this file changes:
#
#     git check-ignore -v WORKING/testbed/s154/prisma/dev.db
#     git add -A --dry-run            # must list nothing under WORKING/
#
# Both cases are listed because NTFS is case-insensitive but CI is not.
# .testbed/ stays as a backstop against the older habit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/WORKING/
/working/
/scratch/
.testbed/
.vite/
.next/
dist/
build/
*.log

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
